# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:15
translate turkish danamoviedate_056879bf:

    # "I meet Dana out at the movie theater and we go find a seat in the back together."
    "Sinemada Dana ile buluşuyorum ve birlikte arka sıralarda bir yer buluyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:17
translate turkish danamoviedate_778237c3:

    # cw "Oh my God, I can't remember the last movie that I went to see in the theater."
    cw "Aman Tanrım, en son ne zaman sinemaya gittiğimi hatırlamıyorum bile."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:18
translate turkish danamoviedate_28e36d10:

    # cw "I missed this so much."
    cw "Bunu çok özlemişim."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:19
translate turkish danamoviedate_7c0dd464:

    # pc "What are we watching?"
    pc "Ne izleyeceğiz?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:21
translate turkish danamoviedate_05b7fce2:

    # cw "I picked out a romantic comedy that I thought looked cute."
    cw "Sevimli göründüğünü düşündüğüm bir romantik komedi seçtim."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:22
translate turkish danamoviedate_2066ff39:

    # cw "I hope you're okay with that?"
    cw "Umarım senin için sorun olmaz?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:23
translate turkish danamoviedate_509f7262:

    # pc "Yeah that's fine. Doesn't matter to me."
    pc "Evet, sorun değil. Bana fark etmez."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:25
translate turkish danamoviedate_770a1a84:

    # cw "Even if you don't like the movie, I'm sure you'll like what comes after, when you take me back home."
    cw "Filmi sevmesen bile, beni eve geri götürdüğünde sonrasında olacakları seveceğinden eminim."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:26
translate turkish danamoviedate_ae871f39:

    # pc "Oh yeah?"
    pc "Öyle mi?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:27
translate turkish danamoviedate_feedb9ad:

    # cw "Oh yeah. I've been thinking about your dick all day."
    cw "Evet, tabii. Bütün gün senin aletini düşündüm."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:29
translate turkish danamoviedate_30143840:

    # cw "But I also really want to see this movie, so even if it's bad, you have to be a good boyfriend and watch it with me."
    cw "Ama bu filmi de gerçekten çok izlemek istiyorum, o yüzden kötü olsa bile iyi bir erkek arkadaş olup benimle birlikte izlemelisin."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:30
translate turkish danamoviedate_2c438d9a:

    # pc "I guess I can do that."
    pc "Sanırım yapabilirim."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:31
translate turkish danamoviedate_3196ae44:

    # "We chat for a bit before the movie starts."
    "Film başlamadan önce biraz sohbet ediyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:37
translate turkish danamoviedate_8de46db7:

    # "Then the theater goes dark and everybody quiets down."
    "Sonra salon kararmaya başlıyor ve herkes sessizleşiyor."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:42
translate turkish danamoviedate_8ec143f8:

    # "We watch the movie together. It's cheesy, but isn't too bad."
    "Filmi birlikte izliyoruz. Biraz klişe ama o kadar da kötü değil."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:43
translate turkish danamoviedate_954db5c8:

    # "And Dana laughs a lot during it, which is nice."
    "Dana film boyunca çok gülüyor, bu hoşuma gidiyor."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:48
translate turkish danamoviedate_2a9c215f:

    # "Towards the end of the movie, she leans over onto my shoulder and I put my arm around her."
    "Filmin sonlarına doğru omzuma yaslanıyor ve ben de kolumu onun omzuna doluyorum."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:49
translate turkish danamoviedate_54e4c6ed:

    # "She seems so happy."
    "Çok mutlu görünüyor."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:54
translate turkish danamoviedate_dc85127c:

    # "When the movie is over, she sits up and looks at me."
    "Film bittiğinde dik oturup bana bakıyor."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:55
translate turkish danamoviedate_fa2d70f3:

    # cw "This was so much fun. Thank you for taking me."
    cw "Bu çok eğlenceliydi. Beni götürdüğün için teşekkürler."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:56
translate turkish danamoviedate_7e0d2bda:

    # pc "You're welcome. The movie wasn't that bad either."
    pc "Rica ederim. Film de o kadar kötü değildi."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:57
translate turkish danamoviedate_12b1dc59:

    # cw "Yeah, I thought it was cute."
    cw "Evet, bence de sevimliydi."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:60
translate turkish danamoviedate_65c1c40b:

    # cw "Now I just want to go home and get naked and sweaty with you. We don't need to sit through the credits."
    cw "Şimdi tek istediğim eve gidip seninle çıplak ve terli olmak. Jeneriği beklememize gerek yok."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:66
translate turkish danamoviedate_eaef44cf:

    # "Ten minutes later, we're in her bedroom and she's naked on the bed, practically begging me to ravage her."
    "On dakika sonra, onun yatak odasındayız ve o yatakta çıplak, adeta onu becermem için yalvarıyor."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:71
translate turkish danamoviedate_56dd956e:

    # cw "Aw really? Okay."
    cw "Ah, gerçekten mi? Tamam."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:72
translate turkish danamoviedate_f42d2233:

    # cw "I'll see you later, [pcname]."
    cw "Görüşürüz, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danamoviedate.rpy:75
translate turkish danamoviedate_35f02591:

    # "I tell Dana goodbye and leave the movie theater to go on with my day."
    "Dana’ya veda edip sinemadan çıkıyorum ve günümü devam ettiriyorum."

